{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"Sokie API","version":"0.1.0","description":"Manage your Sokie servers over HTTP. Make an API key in Settings and send it as a bearer token; a key can do what its scopes and servers allow."},"servers":[{"url":"https://api.sokie.cloud/v1"}],"security":[{"bearer":[]}],"paths":{"/me":{"get":{"operationId":"getMe","tags":["Account"],"summary":"Who am I","description":"The person this key or sign-in acts for, with their email and name.","security":[{"bearer":[]}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Me"}}}},"default":{"description":"Refused","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Refusal"}}}}}}},"/servers":{"get":{"operationId":"listServers","tags":["Servers"],"summary":"List servers","description":"The servers this key or sign-in can see, newest first. Needs `servers:read`.","security":[{"bearer":["servers:read"]}],"parameters":[{"name":"workspace","in":"query","required":false,"description":"The workspace's slug. Unset: the key's workspace, or your default.","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"description":"How many to return, at most 100. Unset: 25.","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":100}},{"name":"cursor","in":"query","required":false,"description":"`continueCursor` from the page before.","schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"page":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ServerSummary"}},"continueCursor":{"type":"string"},"isDone":{"type":"boolean"},"splitCursor":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"pageStatus":{"anyOf":[{"const":"SplitRecommended"},{"const":"SplitRequired"},{"type":"null"}]}},"required":["page","continueCursor","isDone"]}}}},"default":{"description":"Refused","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Refusal"}}}}}},"post":{"operationId":"createServer","tags":["Servers"],"summary":"Create a server","description":"Makes an empty server, open only to its workspace, with the `serverId`, `slug` and address (`url`) it keeps. Deploy to it with `createUpload`, then `deploy`. A key must be one given every server. Needs `servers:write` and `deploys:write`.","security":[{"bearer":["servers:write","deploys:write"]}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string","description":"What to call the server, up to 64 characters."},"workspace":{"type":"string","description":"The workspace's slug. Unset: the key's workspace, or your default."}},"required":["name"],"additionalProperties":false}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ServerCreated"}}}},"default":{"description":"Refused","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Refusal"}}}}}}},"/servers/{slug}":{"get":{"operationId":"getServer","tags":["Servers"],"summary":"Get a server","description":"One server by its slug, with the `serverId` the other routes take. Only a server the key or sign-in reaches, in its workspace; listServers lists those. Needs `servers:read`.","security":[{"bearer":["servers:read"]}],"parameters":[{"name":"slug","in":"path","required":true,"description":"The server's slug.","schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Server"}}}},"default":{"description":"Refused","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Refusal"}}}}}}},"/servers/{serverId}/pause":{"post":{"operationId":"pauseServer","tags":["Servers"],"summary":"Pause a server","description":"Stops the server answering: every call to it is refused until `resumeServer`. What's deployed, its secrets and its settings stay as they are. `active` on getServer says whether